      "review_description": "One out of three tenderers didn't even bother with a home visit, even though it was specifically requested - they were immediately not considered any further.One tenderer both on the phone and at the home visit just spoke in circles and didn't seem to fully and adequately provide answers to questions asked - plus the price offered for the STC was considerably lower than the others.The tender selected was because the person conducting the home visit (the business owner) could very clearly and in fully understandable words answer and explain every question put to them. They were also the only one who undertook an app based \"shade assessment\" that led to a good discussion on the different options for the solar panel configuration on the roof. I had to wait about four weeks before they were available for the installation, but I was quite happy to do so. The installation itself was undertaken over two days and proceeded without any issues.Now waiting for the installation of the new smart meter by Energex before the system can go live.",
