      "review_description": "Alex came to visit at the home to discuss what we needed and how we could work around planned renovations to quote for the best option for our solar installation. Alex was honest and not at all pushy - which was a refreshing change.As the installation was tricky (high pitched, tin roof, obstructing trees/foliage), four guys worked together to get the installation done. There was an initial hiccup/miscommunication with placement of one of the rails (the panels would be placed where skylights will be placed in the renovation) but the installers removed and repositioned with minimal fuss.The installers cleaned up after themselves thoroughly, they were polite and punctual.I would not hesitate to recommend Alex and the team for any tricky solar install!",
