      "review_description": "Alex MacDonald offered a competitive price for a system to run our house off grid. The quoting system was easy to follow and approve.Although the installation took quiet a long period to get everything installed and working, the persistence got it all sorted.The old system was removed and the new Solar Panels(33 x 370w) went up with a slight adjustment to layout. We have 4 strings of varying sizes, one to each compass point to maximise the sun movement during seasons and day. The 2 x 5.0kW Fronius Invertors(Primo Snap & GEN24) installed on external wall. Their was a supply chain delay with the 11kW BYD Battery Box by a month. When the battery box did arrive the battery installation was straight forward. We did have a time in configuring the Full Backup to work, after many calls to Fronius Tech support, and finally got it all working after attempts. Overall very happy its all now working considering the number of components.",
