      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "After obtaining 6 quotes for various 5 to 10kW solar system for my mother’s property in the Samford area in Feb 2020 we chose Macdonald Air and Electrical.Alex attended site and suggested what equipment he could install, along with a detailed site report and quote for equipment options he had suggested.The main thing that struck me with Alex (Macdonald Air and Electrical) was the total lack of sales talk/pressure trying to push the sale to “get the job” he was honest and up front with what he was quoting and why.His price was his price to get the job done right by his company!He quoted good quality equipment at a reasonable price compared with other quotes for similar/same equipment.Fronius 10.0-3-M     31x350W Longi Solar Hi-MOX panelsInstallation was fast and went well after a small delay only due to rain.All his team were polite and very tidy even when the boss was not around the focus was on getting the job done.Good to see in this day and age, very happy with his whole team.From quote to completion and grid connection I would do the same again 100%.I would not hesitate to recommend, and have passed his company name on to others since our installation for Solar and other electrical work.Since the above Solar install I have also had Macdonald Air and Electrical install a 18kW fully ducted multi zone AC system at my mothers house and a 25kW ducted system at my house.More than happy with this company.",
